    <item>
      <title>Anthropic搞了个“双面间谍”：最强AI Claude Fable 5公开，但专家版只给“自己人”开小灶</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/anthropicai-claude-fable-5-20260610154006526-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 15:40:06 +0800</pubDate>
